WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
What does f(3) mean?

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.750
It is not f × 3.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.870
It means: put 3 into the function f.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:16.640
If f(x) = 2x + 1, then f(3) = 7.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:21.013
Just a neat way to name the input and the output.
